Revision history for Net-DAVTalk

0.26    Thu Nov 12 2026
  - add SyncCollection: an RFC 6578 sync-collection REPORT, shared by
    Net::CalDAVTalk's SyncEventLinks and Net::CardDAVTalk's
    SyncContactLinks, so the two no longer disagree
  - SyncCollection follows truncated results (a 507 on the collection,
    RFC 6578 section 3.6) by asking again from the token that came with
    them: Google pages a calendar's sync about 230 events at a time
  - only a 404 marks a member removed; a sync-token of "0" is a token
  - a collection (an href ending in /) is never reported as a member:
    iCloud lists the collection itself, with an etag, among the changes
  - SyncCollection returns hrefs unescaped, as every path this module
    takes and returns is (raw => 1 for them as the server wrote them)
  - add request_href: the escaped absolute path for an href in a request
    body (e.g. a multiget), which an unescaped href is not
  - request_url takes a full http(s) URL as a string, not only as a
    reference: some servers give hrefs that way
  - document request_url (its POD described auth_header)
0.25    Mon Aug 31 2026
  - relicensed from Artistic License 2.0 to the same terms as Perl
    itself (Artistic License 1.0 or GPL version 1 or later)
  - include a LICENSE file in the distribution
  - rewrite the custom-headers merge in SafeRequest (no behaviour change)

0.24    Thu Feb 12 09:29:06 EST 2026
  - add "SafeRequest" API to capture errors (thanks rjbs) PR#6 PR#7

0.23    Wed 22 Jan 15:55 2025
  - pass SSL_options through to HTTP::Tiny

0.22    Mon 14 Mar 12:33 2022
  - set the useragent to the module version rather than always 0.01

0.21    Tue  4 May 12:52 2021
  - uri_decode the homeset when doing discovery
    (makes shortpath work correctly)

0.20    Thu Apr 15 02:29 2021
  - add support for setting custom headers, thanks Hernan Lopes

0.19    Wed May  6 12:34 2020
  - fix handling of the UA timeout

0.18    Tue Apr  7 15:54 2020
  - remove FATAL warnings from DAVTalk module
  - don't double-decode XML (thanks tadzik) PR#1
  - provide the 'ua()' method to get/set the user agent after creation
  - use the UA's own timeout support rather than duplicating it

0.16    Fri May 10 10:41 2019
  - add GetPropsArray API call to get multi-value properties

0.15    Wed Oct 25 10:56 2017
  - allow up to 10 30x redirects

0.14    Mon Mar 20 11:55 2017
  - fix totally broken regex.  Never install version 13 of anything

0.13    Mon Mar 20 11:42 2017
  - remove trailing slash from SetURL to avoid double // in fullpath

0.12    Fri Nov 18 00:53 2016
  - work with attributes with namespaces on them

0.11    Wed Oct 12 13:52 2016
  - avoid adding default namespace to attributes

0.10    Wed Sep 28 11:18 2016
  - fix bug where URI wasn't used an redirects were needed

0.09    Tue May  3 09:07 2016
  - depend on DateTime::Format::ISO8601

0.08    Mon May  2 11:43 2016
  - Obviously there have been tons of changes up until now.
  - this release includes GetProps API call and uses it

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

